WEBVTT

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.918
And it also clears up

00:09:03.942 --> 00:09:07.927
the overwhelmed emergency rooms
in hospitals that we have.

00:09:09.204 --> 00:09:11.347
The third thing
that I want to tell you about

00:09:11.371 --> 00:09:14.976
is very dear to me
and very important to my team.

00:09:16.247 --> 00:09:20.402
We recently started
a first responders self-care program.

00:09:22.437 --> 00:09:23.596
More and more ...

00:09:25.419 --> 00:09:30.673
first responders are experiencing
compassion fatigue and PTSD.